# Base URL for the GitHub activity backend.
#
# Leave UNSET (recommended): the app calls same-origin /api/github-contributions,
# which works everywhere —
#   dev  → Vite proxies /api → http://localhost:4000 (see vite.config.ts)
#   prod → Vercel rewrites /api → the Render service (see vercel.json)
#
# Set it only to bypass the proxies and call Render directly (cross-origin;
# then the backend's CORS_ORIGIN must include this site's URL):
# VITE_API_URL=https://portfolio-github-api.onrender.com
